// =============================================================================
// Chora Content Consumption — Learner Weakness ("Growth Edge") events
// =============================================================================
//
// The Growth-Edge layer persists a per-GCID model of where a learner is shaky,
// fed by TWO sources (source-tagged + merged in chora_consumption):
//   - explicit : the learner uploads a "weakness document" (a marked-up past
//                test PDF/image with right/wrong answers marked, or free-form
//                notes / a scribble). A multimodal analyser (an ai-kernel agent)
//                visually reads it, infers per-item correctness, maps each item
//                to the concept it tests, and extracts the weak concepts.
//   - derived  : performance signals already in chora_consumption
//                (topic_accuracy + Ebbinghaus topic_retention decay) and
//                classroom live-quiz wrong answers (chora.delivery.live_quiz
//                .answered.v1). NOT modelled here — those are intra-consumption
//                projections + a cross-domain subscriber.
//
// LEARNER-FACING TERM is "Growth Edge" (curiosity-first; the Companion / KG paint
// / Daily Dose surface these as frontiers to explore, mastered ones as "grown").
// The internal / instructor / auditor term is "weakness" (3-audience
// explainability). The data is neutral; the framing is per-surface.
//
// Domain placement: per the topic-domain-follows-the-affected-aggregate-root
// convention (see creation/ai_assist.proto header), BOTH events live in the
// `consumption` domain because the affected aggregate is LearnerWeakness in
// chora_consumption — even though weakness.analyzed.v1 is EMITTED by the
// ai-kernel weakness-analyser agent (the emitter does not determine the topic
// domain, exactly as the ai_kernel_orchestrator emits chora.creation.ai_assist.*).
//
// Aggregate root : learner_weakness (chora_consumption; per-GCID Growth Edges)
// Owning domain  : Content Consumption (chora_consumption)
// Owning team    : Team 1 (Content)
// Topic prefix   : chora.consumption.weakness_doc.* + chora.consumption.weakness.*
// Surface        : A+ (Growth Edges view / Daily Dose / Companion / KG paint)
//
// Subscribers:
//   - chora-ai-kernel-orchestrator (weakness-analyser crew) — subscribes to
//     weakness_doc.uploaded.v1; runs the multimodal analysis; emits
//     weakness.analyzed.v1.
//   - chora-consumption — subscribes to weakness.analyzed.v1; upserts the
//     LearnerWeakness aggregate (embedding dedup + nearest-topic resolve).
//   - chora-observability — D1 accountability + cost evidence on analyzed.
// =============================================================================

